{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-04-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DALLAS, APRIL 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.14 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JULY 2, 2021, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 4, 2021.'}